            "st_info_text": "-*-If the mod is only for single player, you do NOT need this page-*-\n\nBecause the current server version cannot directly adapt single-player translations, server-side translation files need to be designed separately.\nHow it works:\nThe sync feature on this page appends all translation codes from the current mod to the end of the game's original translation file,\ngenerating a new translation file, which then overwrites the original translation file in the server's designated directory.\nTypical path: server_directory\\media\\lua\\shared\\Translate\\{CN or EN}.\nCN is Chinese, EN is English. Place the newly generated translation files into the corresponding language directories.\n\n-*-If you don't understand, contact the author or developer. DO NOT mess with it on your own!!!-*-",
